WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.810
I stopped taking it after we fucking broke up
to give my my body a break from the hormones!

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:10.930
I don't think you understand. Like, I-I
seriously can't deal with this right now. I have-

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.090
Okay. Okay. Danny, I'm sorry it's so stressful for
you.

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:13.790
Stop!

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:14.990
That's not what I meant.

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:15.430
Why are you yelling?

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.950
Because I'm fucking frustrated! And we're both yelling!

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:20.720
You yelled first.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:26.780
Clare, I can barely pay rent. And the band...

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.540
I can't be in South America when you're
having a baby, Clare. I can't.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:33.270
South America?

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:36.770
Yeah. Brazil and Argentina.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.330
What? Shit.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:43.730
We're just-

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:44.340
Danny. Shit.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.140
the openers.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:50.250
It's not- well, first of two openings.
It's nothing. What am I talking about?

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.970
I feel like a fucking asshole talking about my band
right now. Who cares about my band?

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.560
I care about your band. You care about your
band. And you should.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.610
I love... I love your band.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:06.000
I love you.

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:13.170
And I don't want to be some cliché of an
absentee father, either.

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:14.820
My family will fucking disown me.

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.140
Yeah, that's... that's not the same as loving me.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:26.790
I do love you.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:27.840
You fucking know that, Clare.

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:35.480
Okay, um...

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:47.430
The timing is terrible. Obviously. Yeah.
We're not even together.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:48.720
Like this isn't that hard to figure out.

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.890
I mean, this is how we got back together. We
always knew this would be the reason.

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:53.790
Exactly.

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:04.980
I'd have to give up music. I'd have to- I'd
have to get a desk job or wherever gives benefits.

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:08.460
Like, what are my skills? What can
I even do? I'm gonna have to go back to school.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:09.510
Get a fucking degree.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:10.760
Danny, stop!

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.630
Just stop for a second!

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:26.210
It's okay.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:29.540
No, it's not.

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:35.240
It's okay. We broke up for a reason, and we
need to go out.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:42.320
And we need to live our lives. You go on
tour, fucking kill Argentina. Fucking kill Brazil.

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:48.440
I'm going to- I'm going to go to
Iceland and climb a glacier or something.

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:55.730
I'm going to live my life. And I think you
should live yours.

